From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kern0x1b <kern0x1b@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] JavaScriptCore: keep B3, Air, FTL and WebAssembly building on
 32-bit

The B3, Air, FTL, LOL and WebAssembly files the 32-bit build still compiles,
with the 32-bit arms the carried JIT expects from them, and the generators
that produce their headers. FTL itself stays off on this port; these files are
what the rest of JavaScriptCore includes.
